    grouped.verbatim,
    messages,
    regionEnd,
    targetMessageCount,
  );
  // Pairing belt-and-suspenders: the kept tail may carry pre-broken
  // pairing in the input; the request must never propagate it.
  return repairToolPairing(merged).messages;
